    Bug 1901970 - Fix mailTabs.getSelectedMessages() not returning the selected messages, if a context menu is open. r=aleca


    The API used `dbView.getSelectedMsgHdrs()` to retrieve the selected
    messages. However, that function is supressing the actual selected
    messages, if a context menu had been opened on an unselected message.

    This patch changes the behavior for `mailTabs.getSelectedMessages()` to
    always return the selected messages. The patch does not change the
    behavior for `menus.OnShowData` and `menus.OnClickedData`, which
    should return the messages the context action should act upon (identical
    to Thunderbirds own UI behavior).

    The patch adds a test for both, and a test to verify
    `mailTabs.setSelectedMessages()` in Manifest V3.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D213406

